A symmetric 2-tensor $\kappa$ is Killing if the completely symmetric
part of $\nabla\kappa$ vanishes, i.e.
\begin{equation}\label{eq:def_Killing}
\forall p\in M,x\in T_pM:\;\nabla_x\kappa(x,x)\;\;=\;\;0.
\end{equation}

